e86a022c3c9dcac51b94b2e0f7fe5a363", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> and\n<MATH_0002> be categories fibred in groupoids, and\nsuppose that <MATH_0003> is a functor over\n<MATH_0004>.\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> Then <MATH_0005> is faithful (resp.<SPACE_0001>fully faithful, resp.<SPACE_0002>an equivalence)\nif and only if for each <MATH_0006> the induced functor\n<MATH_0007> is faithful\n(resp.<SPACE_0003>fully faithful, resp.<SPACE_0004>an equivalence).\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0008> is an equivalence, then <MATH_0009> is an equivalence in the\n<MATH_0010>-category of categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0011>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b6a56ee0161fd60ed50a4aad195de0c1ea913cd40861c406b110f1460e5cf578", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:003Z:lemma/0001"}, "state": "READY"}, "inventory:categories:04Z7:lemma/0001": {"context_hash": "sha256:fd2aa1932295790907e66886afb0d11a4b40c5e968395ffeb656f46c12e46a46", "inventory_id": "inventory:categories:04Z7:lemma/0001", "kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 262101, "byte_start": 261639, "file": "categories.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:00bf890f741adf4540641102bf3f47f17b22bb66e4e929cba2fcdfb74edced86", "line_end": 7377, "line_start": 7364}, "owner_tag": "04Z7", "parent_tag": "003S", "semantic_path": "lemma/0001", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "003S", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-fully-faithful-diagonal-equivalence}", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$p : \\mathcal{S}\\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$p' : \\mathcal{S'}\\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$G : \\mathcal{S}\\to \\mathcal {S}'$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$G$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\Delta_G :\n\\mathcal{S}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{S} \\times_{G, \\mathcal{S}', G} \\mathcal{S}\n$$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT